# Baseline: upstream files allowed to couple to Hyprland directly — by `import Quickshell.Hyprland`
# OR by a `hyprctl` shell-out. The gate (check-no-new-hyprland-coupling.sh) fails any OTHER file that
# does either; those must go through services/Compositor.qml instead.
# When you migrate a file onto Compositor, DELETE its line here in the same change.
# One path per line, repo-relative. Comments (#) and blank lines are ignored.

# -- Quickshell.Hyprland importers (10) --
services/Hypr.qml
modules/drawers/ContentWindow.qml
modules/bar/components/workspaces/Workspaces.qml
modules/bar/components/workspaces/Workspace.qml
modules/bar/components/workspaces/SpecialWorkspaces.qml
modules/bar/popouts/Wrapper.qml
modules/windowinfo/WindowInfo.qml
modules/windowinfo/Preview.qml
modules/windowinfo/Details.qml
components/misc/CustomShortcut.qml

# -- hyprctl shell-outs (2) --
modules/bar/popouts/kblayout/KbLayoutModel.qml
modules/areapicker/Picker.qml
